    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.poster.avif?t=1746947895\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.webm?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.mp4?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condominium is a first-person atmospheric horror game. No cheap jump-scares or monsters that chase you. You will travel through the sleepy memories of Cesare.  <br>Realistic Italian atmospheres and unique assets are been handmade to achieve an autentic 90's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.poster.avif?t=1746947895\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.webm?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.mp4?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why Cesare is alone in a place that is so familiar but hostile at the same time.  <br>This condominium is more twisted than it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well crafted atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphycs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian 90's vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All handmade assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.poster.avif?t=1746947895\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.webm?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/2c388298263626a0970ef3477a7711d2.mp4?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condominium is a first-person atmospheric horror game. No cheap jump-scares or monsters that chase you. You will travel through the sleepy memories of Cesare.  <br>Realistic Italian atmospheres and unique assets are been handmade to achieve an autentic 90's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.poster.avif?t=1746947895\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.webm?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160470/extras/5d1e31c27e2828d65df1c2a2394bd713.mp4?t=1746947895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why Cesare is alone in a place that is so familiar but hostile at the same time.  <br>This condominium is more twisted than it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well crafted atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphycs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian 90's vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All handmade assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Atmospheric and calm horror, set in an disturbing Italian condominium. A story-driven adventure into the past traumas of Cesare. No hiding or running from monsters! Follow the dreamy shadows of your childhood trough the liminal spaces of your grandma's apartment.",
